{"id":"00299","root":"uni00299_1","name":{"ja":"望月　卯奈","en":"Mochizuki Una"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"望月　卯奈","en":"Mochizuki Una"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-02-29","limited":true,"characterId":206,"profile":{"ja":"獣遁の術使いの学生対魔忍。肉体の一部をウサギに獣化させる能力をもつ。優れた聴覚と高い瞬発力で、斥候向きの対魔忍として評価されている。戦闘においては強靭な脚力と対魔殺法を組み合わせた肉弾戦を得意とする。ちなみに噛みつきも高い威力を誇るのだが、本人は使いたがらない。常に人の輪の中心にいるタイプで、友人が多く、朝から晩までエネルギッシュに活動している。その反面、孤独には弱く、長時間の単独任務などには不安が残る。可愛らしい容姿と近い距離感から校内にはファンが多いが、特に誰かと付き合うと言った素振りは見られない。なお、忍法の特性上足の筋力が発達し、特に太腿が太くなっている事を内心気にしている。","en":"Mochizuki Una is a student Taimanin who uses Beast-style techniques. She can transform parts of her body into a rabbit, granting her keen hearing and explosive speed, which earns her a reputation as an excellent scout. In combat she favors powerful melee attacks that combine her sturdy legs with anti-demon killing methods. Though her bite packs a hefty punch, she prefers not to use it. She's the type who always stays at the center of a crowd, has many friends, and stays energetic from dawn till dusk. On the flip side, she's vulnerable to loneliness and feels uneasy on long solo missions. Her cute looks and approachable demeanor make her popular around campus, yet she shows no signs of dating anyone. Because of her ninja techniques, her leg muscles—especially her thighs—have become noticeably thick, a fact she's somewhat self-conscious about."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"高梨はなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00299_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1096,2192],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[151,302],"def":[92,184],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","490001"],"evolve":[["evo00001",5],["evo00002",15],["evo00003",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00299_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1692,3384],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[237,474],"def":[119,238],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","490001","490002"],"e